      "guide": "Trust is earned by completing Breakfast Run, one of the named missions in the early campaign. Unlike the broad chapter awards, this one is tied to a single mission, so the cleanest approach is to take the mission as soon as it appears and finish it without switching to free roam halfway through. Read the brief before you launch it: the mission rewards a careful approach rather than a fast one, and restarting from the pause menu is faster than driving back across the city after a mistake. The trophy registers on the mission-passed screen, not during the cutscene, so wait for the results panel before you pause. Because it sits in the story part of the list, spoiler mode will mask its name until you tick it; that is deliberate and helps you keep the early plot a surprise. Once cleared, mark it and check the other mission rows in the same stage.",
