      "description": "Complete The Cartel Heist.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "Break the Bank is awarded for finishing The Cartel Heist. Heist missions in this guide are worth treating as their own little projects: they have a planning phase, a loadout choice and an execution phase, and the trophy is attached to the successful execution. Prepare before you launch the finale by topping up ammo, choosing a vehicle with room to manoeuvre and reading the approach options on the planning board. If the attempt goes wrong, use the mission restart rather than fleeing the scene, because a heist that ends in a failed state will not register the completion flag. The notification appears on the pass screen together with the payout. As a mission trophy in a story chapter, it is flagged missable in the left pane; keep the chapter save until the row is ticked. Afterward, compare it with the other Chapter 2 entries so the watchlist stays accurate.",
