      "name": "Family Matters",
      "description": "Complete Child's Play.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "Family Matters is the trophy for completing Child's Play. The mission sits inside Chapter 2 and, like the other named missions in that stretch, it is only available while the chapter is active. Work through it from the mission marker rather than stumbling into it during free roam; that guarantees the correct mission variant is loaded and avoids a partial attempt being recorded. The objectives reward patience, so take cover and clear threats methodically instead of sprinting to the exit. Once the last objective completes, remain in the results screen until the trophy pops, then save. In the left pane this row carries a MISSABLE badge and, if you have spoiler mode enabled, a hidden name until it is earned. Tick it promptly so your tracker reflects that the chapter's risk is over, and use the related-trophy links at the bottom of this page to jump to the other Chapter 2 missions.",
