      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "DWNFALL is the award for completing the mission called Headliners. The name gives away nothing about the objective, which is another reason to read the briefing when the marker appears. Treat the mission as a single block: launch it with a full health bar and enough ammunition, follow the staged objectives, and use the checkpoint restart if something goes wrong instead of driving away. The trophy fires on the mission-complete screen, so do not skip that panel. This row sits in the Chapter 3 group of the checklist, and the group heading is clickable in the Roadmap view to filter the list down to that stage. That is useful here because Chapter 3 contains several mission trophies and it is easy to assume you cleared one when you actually cleared its neighbour. Mark the trophy as earned only after the notification, then use the watchlist to confirm what remains.",
