      "description": "Complete VCIA Takedown.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "Hi-Jacked is earned by completing VCIA Takedown. It is a mission trophy rather than a collectible, so there is no counter to watch and no map icon to hunt; the only requirement is a clean completion of the named mission. Because the mission is tied to Chapter 3, the safest plan is to handle it before you advance the main story past that chapter. Approach it with a vehicle that can take a chase and keep some armour in reserve, since the later objectives tend to escalate quickly. A failed attempt should be retried from the mission checkpoint rather than by returning later. The trophy appears on the pass screen and the ledger row can then be ticked. If spoiler mode is on, the name stays masked until that tick, which is useful when you are sharing the screen. The related-trophy links below take you to the other mission awards in the same chapter.",
