      "guide": "Snow Storm is the trophy awarded for completing Operation Savage Glory, the last named mission in the Chapter 4 group. It is also the most demanding of the chapter mission awards, so give it a clear run rather than squeezing it between other objectives. Prepare by restocking ammunition, choosing a vehicle suited to the terrain and saving beforehand; the mission has a long middle section and restarting from its own checkpoint is much cheaper than replaying the chapter. The trophy registers when the mission passes, alongside the payout screen. This is one of the rows the missable watchlist keeps at the top: if the Chapter 4 finale has already been played, you will need the manual save you made before it. Tick the entry as soon as the notification appears, then look at the Endgame stage to see how close you are to the final stretch of the route.",
