      "name": "A Long Road",
      "description": "Attain 100% Completion.",
      "grade": "gold",
      "guide": "A Long Road is the second gold trophy and the one that asks for full completion rather than a single task. The percentage is an aggregate: story missions, stranger strands, collectibles, challenges and exploration all feed it, which is why it should be the last major target rather than something you chase from the first hour. Use the in-game progress screen to see which categories are short, then cross-reference them with the Collectibles view in this app; each table there names the in-game label for a count so you can match the game's language to the tracker. Do not expect the percentage to jump immediately after a trophy pops, because the completion stat updates on its own schedule and often needs a save or a visit to a safe house. Once every category is full, the trophy follows. Treat it as the final check before the platinum, not as a separate grind you can finish early.",
