      "id": 18,
      "name": "Top Fun",
      "description": "Win a Top Fun Drone Race at every location.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "Top Fun is awarded for winning a drone race at every location. The game tracks fourteen separate race sites, each with its own marker, so the task is a travel loop rather than a single hard event. Filter the map for the drone icon and visit one site at a time; winning once at a location is enough, and repeating a course you have already won does not advance the count. The races themselves are short and forgiving, but they are easy to fail by clipping scenery on the last gate, so take the first lap slowly and learn the route before pushing for speed. After each win, check the map to confirm the icon changed state before moving on, since a result screen that was skipped can leave the site unrecorded. Save at a safe house between clusters of locations. The Collectibles view lists the same required count so you can compare the game's tally with your tracker.",
