      "id": 19,
      "name": "Earn Cash, Not Kudos",
      "description": "Win 20 different races.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "Earn Cash, Not Kudos asks for wins in twenty different races. The word different is the whole challenge: the counter advances only when a race you have not won before is completed in first place. Keep a simple list of the races you have entered, or use the race list in the game, because it is easy to assume a repeat victory helped when it did not. Start with the short street races scattered around the map, since they can be finished quickly and have forgiving traffic, then move to longer events once you know the handling model. If a race repeatedly ends in second place, change the vehicle class rather than replaying the same mistake. After each win, return to the race list and confirm that the event is marked as completed before choosing the next one. Saving between sessions protects the tally, and the tracker's count field records the same target for quick reference.",
