      "id": 22,
      "name": "Road to Rehabilitation",
      "description": "Complete the final mission for Andy.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "Road to Rehabilitation is earned by finishing Andy's final mission. Andy is one of the strangers whose requests form a short chain, and the last step only becomes available once the earlier requests are completed. The reliable pattern is to accept each request as soon as its marker appears, complete it, and then wait for the follow-up call rather than hunting for the next marker immediately. The final mission is straightforward but includes a travel segment, so set a waypoint and clear the route before you commit; being chased across the map with a fragile vehicle is the most common reason for a retry. The trophy registers on the mission-passed screen. This entry counts toward the broader stranger-strand trophy as well, so tick both when the count allows. Keeping the activity list open between requests makes the chain much easier to follow and avoids returning to an area after its window has closed.",
