      "description": "Complete the final mission for Kenton.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "This Was No Boat Accident is the award for finishing Kenton's last mission. As with the other stranger chains, the final request is gated behind the earlier steps, and the game gives you a call when the next stage is ready. Treat the chain as a checklist inside the larger ledger: accept each task, finish it without detours, and check your phone before driving off. The finale involves water and a vehicle transition, so choose a route that lets you reach the dock without attracting attention, and restart the mission if the transport is destroyed rather than improvising. The trophy pops when the mission passes. It also moves the stranger-strand counter forward, which you can verify in the Collectibles view. Because the descriptions for these trophies are deliberately quirky, the guide page spells out which chain each one belongs to so you never confuse Kenton's finale with another stranger's.",
