      "guide": "The Lone Rider is awarded for completing Billy's final mission. The chain is short, but it is spread across different parts of the map, so the efficient approach is to handle each request when it is offered rather than waiting until you happen to be nearby. The last mission includes a driving section that rewards a steady hand: stay on the road, avoid drawing a wanted level and let the scripted events play out instead of trying to shortcut them. If a step fails, use the mission restart because the chain does not compensate for an improvised solution. The trophy appears on the pass screen, and the stranger-strand counter should advance at the same time. This is one of several similarly named trophies in the Misc stage, so use the related links at the bottom of this page to jump between Andy, Kenton, Randy and Tyrone without losing your place in the ledger.",
