      "description": "Complete 8 mission strands for strangers across the state of Leonida.",
      "grade": "silver",
      "guide": "Strangers & Freaks is a silver trophy for completing eight mission strands across Leonida. PlayStation counts a strand only when its final mission is cleared, so partial chains do not help. The cleanest method is to make a list of the strangers you have met, then finish each chain in one sitting as soon as its last marker appears; Andy, Kenton, Billy, Randy and Tyrone are among the names you will encounter along the way. Keep your phone in view after each mission, because follow-up calls are how the game announces the next step. Some strands only appear after certain story chapters, so if you cannot reach eight, return after the finale. Save between chains and check the count in the Collectibles view, which records the same target of eight and the in-game label for the counter. Do not assume that simply meeting a stranger moves the number.",
