      "guide": "Spin On This! is awarded for completing Tyrone's final mission. Tyrone's chain is one of the shorter stranger sequences, which makes it a good first target when you start working through the miscellaneous stage. Finish the introductory requests, then check your phone for the last job; the game will not place the finale on the map until that call has been received. The mission itself is light on combat and heavy on timing, so read the instructions at the start and follow the marked route instead of improvising. A botched attempt can be restarted from the pause menu. When the mission passes, the trophy appears and the stranger-strand tally moves by one. Use the related-trophy links beneath this guide to move to the other named chains, and keep the ledger's search box handy if you want to jump straight to a particular stranger by name.",
