      "id": 28,
      "name": "Positive Mental Attitude",
      "description": "Meditate at every spot across Leonida.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "Positive Mental Attitude asks you to meditate at every spot in Leonida. The game tracks eighteen individual locations, and each one is activated by interacting with the spot and completing the short meditation animation. Because the spots are scattered across the state, the sensible route is to travel region by region rather than teleporting back and forth; the Collectibles view gives the same required count so you can check progress after each sweep. Filter the map for the meditation icon and mark off each site as you arrive. Interrupting the animation does not register the spot, so stay still until the visual cue completes. A quick save at a nearby safe house between regions protects the tally. Once the eighteenth spot is done, the trophy pops immediately. This is a calm, low-risk collectible task and a good one to interleave with exploration, since many meditation spots sit close to other map markers.",
