      "id": 30,
      "name": "Don't Touch My Deck",
      "description": "Complete 3 Collectible Card sets.",
      "grade": "silver",
      "guide": "Don't Touch My Deck is the silver trophy for completing three Collectible Card sets. The game tracks three separate sets, and each set needs its own group of cards, so trading duplicates does not advance the count unless the missing card is actually acquired. Begin by checking the card menu: it shows which sets exist and which slots are empty. Then work the city location by location, picking up packs and trading with contacts who can fill specific gaps. Keep a note of the cards you are missing before each trading session, because it is easy to accept a duplicate. The trophy fires when the third set is completed and its final card is added. Use the Collectibles view to confirm that the target is three sets rather than three individual cards. Saving between trading sessions is wise, as some contacts only refresh their stock after a day cycle or a story beat.",
