      "guide": "You WAiNKer! is a silver trophy awarded at one hundred WAiNK It locations. The counter is literal: one confirmed interaction at a distinct site adds one, and repeating an already counted site adds nothing. Because the target is large, organisation matters more than speed. Work the map in districts, filtering for the WAiNK It markers and finishing every marker in a district before moving to the next. The Collectibles view records the same one-hundred target and the in-game label, so check it after each district to see how many remain. Some sites are on rooftops or behind gated areas and only appear after the story opens them, so leave a small remainder for the endgame sweep. Avoid saving over your only late-game file while you grind. When the hundredth interaction registers, the trophy pops immediately.",
