    {
      "id": 32,
      "name": "One Last Thing",
      "description": "Complete 50 Challenges.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "One Last Thing is earned by completing fifty challenges. The game keeps these in a challenge list with individual entries, so the counter advances only when a challenge is actually passed rather than attempted. Start by sorting the list by type and clear the short time trials first; they build momentum and often unlock more demanding variants. Read the objective carefully, because several challenges impose restrictions such as a vehicle class or a no-damage rule that are easy to break by accident. If a challenge repeatedly fails, leave it and return later with a different vehicle instead of burning time on the same attempt. Check the challenge list after each session and save. Fifty is a large tally, so it is best spread across the whole playthrough rather than saved for one long sitting; the tracker's count field keeps the target visible whenever you open this page.",
