      "id": 33,
      "name": "Hot Together",
      "description": "Lose a 4 star Wanted Level with your partner and escape the heat.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "Hot Together is one of the partner moments and asks you to lose a four-star wanted level with your partner and escape the heat. The trick is preparation: a four-star chase is much easier to survive if you leave the city core, use a vehicle with good acceleration and head for a known escape route such as an underpass or the waterfront. Start the activity from the partner menu rather than provoking police at random, because the game needs to track the activity as active. Keep your partner close; the award is for the shared escape, so losing them midway can void the attempt. Drive steadily, break line of sight and stay out of sight long enough for the wanted level to drop. The trophy pops once the escape is complete. Since this is a chapter-tied partner event, it is flagged missable and sits in the watchlist until you tick it.",
