      "id": 34,
      "name": "Retail Therapy",
      "description": "Rob 3 shops back-to-back with your partner without losing your Wanted Level.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "Retail Therapy asks you to rob three shops back-to-back with your partner without losing your wanted level. Unlike the escape trophy beside it, this one rewards keeping the heat on: the sequence only counts if the wanted meter never drops between hits. Plan a route with three close shops before you begin, because hunting for the next target while stars are flashing wastes precious time. Park nearby, move quickly, and let your partner handle the crowd while you take the register. Avoid crashing between shops; a wreck can cost enough seconds for the wanted level to decay. The trophy appears after the third robbery is banked. Because the partner events are available only during a limited story window, this row is marked missable in the ledger and stays in the watchlist until cleared. If the chain breaks, restart the activity from its menu rather than trying a fourth shop.",
