      "name": "Whip It Good",
      "description": "Discover 100 vehicles.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "Whip It Good is awarded for discovering one hundred vehicles. Discovery is recorded when you first enter or properly register a model, so simply seeing cars parked on a street will not move the counter. The efficient technique is to drive a broad loop through different districts, stopping to enter any model you have not logged before, and to check the vehicle catalogue after each loop. The Collectibles view shows the same one-hundred target, so it is easy to compare your tracker with the in-game list. Some rare models only appear after certain missions or at specific times, which is why a final pass late in the game is sensible. Keep a mental note of the districts you have swept to avoid doubling back. The trophy pops as soon as the hundredth distinct vehicle is registered, so watch for it while you are still driving rather than after you exit.",
