      "name": "Gunslinger",
      "description": "Take down 5 enemies in a single use of Combat Focus.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "Gunslinger asks you to take down five enemies during a single use of Combat Focus. The wording is precise: all five knockouts must happen inside one activation, so spreading them across several uses will not count. The reliable method is to find a location with a predictable group of hostile enemies, such as a gang hideout or an active police standoff, and let them cluster before you activate the ability. Enter with a weapon that can drop a target in one or two hits and enough ammunition to avoid a reload mid-window. Position yourself with a clear line of sight to several enemies at once, activate Combat Focus and take the five nearest targets in quick succession. If the ability ends early, reload the encounter and try again rather than forcing the last takedown. The trophy registers as soon as the fifth enemy goes down within the same activation.",
