    {
      "id": 37,
      "name": "Catch Me If You Can",
      "description": "Make an unscheduled departure at VCIA.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "Catch Me If You Can is awarded for making an unscheduled departure at VCIA. The description is deliberately playful, but the requirement is an action rather than a mission reward: you need to leave the airport in a way the game does not script. The standard approach is to reach the airfield, find a suitable aircraft or service vehicle and take off or drive out through a route that is not the normal passenger exit. Because the game treats this as a discovery, a normal arrival and departure through the terminal will not satisfy it. Prepare by saving nearby and clearing any security presence that might intercept you. Once the unscheduled exit is registered, the trophy pops and the row can be ticked. This entry is part of the hidden set, so on PlayStation it does not appear in the list until it has been earned; the ledger shows a HIDDEN badge to remind you of that.",
      "hidden": true,
