      "guide": "Challenging Tank is one of the trophies whose official description is a joke rather than an instruction, so it pays to translate it before you play. The reference is to the military vehicles that appear in the game, and the task is to deal with one of them rather than simply watch it drive past. Look for a Rhino at a military presence or during a high wanted level, and make a manual save before you engage. A tank is far tougher than a road vehicle, so bring heavy weaponry, keep moving and use buildings for cover while you wait for a reload window. Explosive damage is usually more effective than small-arms fire. If the encounter ends with the tank destroyed or escaped and no trophy, reload and try again. The award registers on the takedown event, not on a mission screen. It is a hidden trophy, which is why the ledger marks it as such.",
