      "description": "Rob a jewelry store without being detected.",
      "grade": "bronze",
      "guide": "Sneakthief is earned by robbing a jewelry store without being detected. The requirement is stricter than simply surviving: a single witness who raises the alarm can invalidate the attempt, so treat this as a stealth exercise rather than a firefight. Scout the store first, note camera positions and the patrol route of staff, and choose an entrance that keeps you out of direct sight. A mask or disguise helps, and taking out cameras before they spot you is safer than hoping they miss a quick movement. Take the display cases calmly and exit by a quiet route; sprinting through the lobby is what tends to trigger detection. If the alarm goes off, reload the save and start again instead of trying to outrun the consequences. The trophy fires once the robbery is completed with no detection registered. This is a hidden trophy, so the HIDDEN badge in the list is your reminder that it will not show on PlayStation until you earn it.",
