      "guide": "Maximum Withdrawal is a silver trophy for robbing five bank vaults and escaping. Five is the exact count PlayStation tracks, so a robbery that ends with you being arrested or killed does not advance it. The sensible preparation is a reliable crew if the game offers one, a vehicle parked close to the exit and a route away from the busiest roads. Most vault sequences have a time pressure once the alarm sounds, so learn the layout on a first visit and use a faster route on the next. Keep an eye on the escape condition: reaching the marker with the loot still in your possession is what seals the count. If a run fails, switch to a different bank rather than repeating the same approach. Check the count against the Collectibles view after each successful escape. The trophy appears when the fifth vault is banked and the getaway completes successfully.",
